      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @{635ae287f95d3b45239c34e1|full_name}! Thanks for reporting the issue.\n\nCan you please check whether you use `Utilities.IsValid` on the result of the raycast? That should allow you to avoid interacting with items on accident.",
